# Environment Notes

_This file is populated by IRIS during initialization. When you see this placeholder text, initialization has not yet been run._

To populate this file:

1. Ensure the MCPs IRIS needs are connected — ticketing, device management, source of truth
2. Run `/iris discover` — or simply ask IRIS to work a ticket and it will initialize on first use
3. IRIS will discover the environment and overwrite this file with what it learned

To refresh this file after the environment changes:

- Run `/iris discover` — IRIS will re-run discovery, diff against the current contents, and update only what's new or changed

